<li><span class="media-time" data-start="2506.000">41:46</span> :config and setq is nicer than :custom for C-x C-e purposes (eval-last-sexp)</li>
<li><span class="media-time" data-start="2731.000">45:31</span> Culture of documentation and sharing</li>
